  { id: "who", h2: "Who the Women’s Trauma IOP in Connecticut is for",
    paras: [
      "The Women’s Trauma IOP is a women-only, trauma-informed intensive outpatient program for adult women whose past trauma still shapes their sleep, mood, relationships or daily life. It is for women who need more than a weekly therapy hour, but who want to heal while living at home and keeping up with work and family.",
